window.bookSummaryJSON = "<p><b>A grumpy human servant.</b></p> <p><b>An arrogant bodyguard.</b></p> <p><b>The scoundrel that broke my heart…</b></p> <p><b>I'm queen of the ashes... Now what?</b><br> <br> My kingdom is in ruins, and I have to find my way back to my throne and my people.<br> <br> To take back control of the night court, I need my men by my side. All three of them, though they're not exactly on board...yet.<br> <br> <b>The crown of shadows doesn't care for love, only blood.<br> Love...is dangerous.</b><br> <br> <i>Queen of Ashes and Scars is the second and final book in the Throne of Shadows series. It's a fast-paced, sizzling romance duet set in the deadly Delacroix night court. You’ll love this story if you like sexy vampire bites, enemies-to-lovers relationships, and heroes who love to share.</i></p> <p><i>This duet is set in the same world as Magnetic and Shadow Witch, but it stands alone. Pick up your steaming-hot copy now!</i></p>"; 
